Well,

I've tried hard to do the task. I read twice LFB, once TCLL, I practiced a 
lot with Memrise, I did assemble some bi-lingual translations, and tried to 
memorize some short stories and read some of the posts in this group. 
However, my proficiency in Lojban is still very modest.

But now I am loosing momentum... I quit Memrise for a couple of months and 
now I cannot find a way to get back to where I was there...

Since I am totally decided to learn Lojban, I need desperately some 
help/company for not abandoning.

Would be anyone available for giving me some *paid* assistance? Something 
like spending two to four hours per week assigning me some homework and 
then reviewing it or sending me questions/exercises on Lojban, etc.? Of 
course I would like this person to have a reasonable level of Lojban to be 
not my partner but my guidance.

We should find a way for doing payments in a viable way, something as 
paypal or credit card... or something else ... bank transfers are too 
expensive... or maybe I can pay by doing internet purchases of books or 
something like that that my tutor could need.

Let's see if this can work!

mu'o mi'e la .albaros.

